  <h1>About the Conference</h1>
</div></div>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <p class="lead">The PACE-2027 conference aims to bring together scientists, technocrats, scholars, and young researchers to present the latest advancements across all domains of civil engineering. The conference emphasizes sustainability, resilience, and data-driven solutions. It fosters collaboration, knowledge exchange, and innovation for next-generation infrastructure systems.</p>

  <h3>Organised By</h3>
  <p class="lead">Department of Civil Engineering, Poornima University, Jaipur, Rajasthan, India. The department offers B.Tech, M.Tech and PhD programmes with a focus on advanced infrastructure development, sustainable design and asset management.</p>

  <h3>Publication</h3>
  <ul class="bul">
    <li>All accepted and presented papers are proposed to be published in the Conference Proceedings with an ISBN.</li>
    <li>A soft copy of the proceedings will be provided to the corresponding author.</li>
    <li>Selected papers are proposed to be recommended for publication in Scopus and/or Web of Science indexed journals, subject to the respective journal's peer-review process and publication policies. Applicable Article Processing Charges (APCs), if any, shall be borne by the authors.</li>
  </ul>

